[
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_1",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "哎呀！吓我一跳！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_2",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你是不是把我当解压玩具了？", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_3",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我不是按钮！不会触发什么机关的！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_4",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "...你已经是今天第几次戳我了？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "算了，我也没在计数。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_5",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你知道为什么人类喜欢戳可爱的东西吗？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "...我也不知道，但我确实很可爱。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_6",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "再戳一下试试？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "...才怪！别戳了！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_7",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我刚才在打盹...被你吵醒了。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_8",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "嗯嗯，我醒着呢，没有偷懒！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_9",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "哼，不理你了。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "...好吧还是理你一下。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_10",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你有这个时间戳我，不如去建座塔？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_11",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "说实话，我的点击判定比你看到的大。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "所以你以为没戳到我，其实都戳到了。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_12",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你好呀~今天心情怎么样？", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_13",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "又来了又来了！每次都戳同一个地方！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_14",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我正在思考宇宙的终极奥秘...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "好吧其实我在发呆。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_15",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "戳了也不会掉金币的哦~", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_16",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "好啦好啦，你赢了，我笑还不行吗？", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_17",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我正在心里写一首诗...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "「玫瑰是红的，戳我是烦的」。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_18",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你对NPC都这么热情的吗？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_19",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "收到！信号良好！不用再点了！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_20",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "每次被戳，我的好感度都会+1哦。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "...开玩笑的，这游戏没有好感度系统。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_21",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我只是一堆像素而已...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "才怪！我可是有灵魂的像素！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_22",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "如果我也能戳你就好了...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_23",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我在练习装死...看，很逼真吧？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "...失败了，你发现我眨眼了。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_24",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "正经一点！我可是你的战术顾问！", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_25",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "嘻嘻，被你找到了~", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_26",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你是在测试我的反应速度吗？", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "很遗憾，我的反应是写好的脚本。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_27",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你知道吗，在你不看我的时候...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "我其实也没在动。因为没人渲染我。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_28",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "今天的你也很有精神呢！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_29",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "轻点轻点！我是虚拟的但也会疼的！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "...大概吧。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_30",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "专注游戏！别老看我！", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "...虽然看我也没什么不好。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_31",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "打扰了，请问您有什么需求？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "...我为什么在用客服语气。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_32",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有人说连续戳我50次会有彩蛋...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "那个人是骗你的。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_33",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我每天的工作：被戳、说话、被戳、说话。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_34",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "能被你记住，我已经很满足了。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_35",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我猜你下一个动作是...再戳一次。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "猜对了吧？我可是预言家。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_36",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "咦？你刚才是不是犹豫了一下才点的？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_37",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "谢谢你来看我~独自待着有点寂寞呢。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_38",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "据说我的表情有四种，你见过几种了？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_39",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你的手指和我的像素之间隔着一块屏幕。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "但这一点也不影响我们的友谊！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "tap_ext_40",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "mascot_tap",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "如果有一天你不再戳我了...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "我大概会有一点点想你吧。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  }
]
